%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/url_test.clj:185 (special-chars-test)
testing: Handle special characters in encodeURIComponent
元の形: url/encodeURIComponent の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import encodeURIComponent from dw::core::URL
output application/json
---
encodeURIComponent("!@#\$%^&*()[]{}|\\:\";<>?,./")
%%% output application/json
"!%40%23%24%25%5E%26*()%5B%5D%7B%7D%7C%5C%3A%22%3B%3C%3E%3F%2C.%2F"
